{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37533","headline":"从叔郎中諴辍自秋曹分符安陆属羣盗倡炽流毒江壖竟以援兵不来城池失守例削今任却叙省衔退居荆汉之间颇得琴尊之趣因有寄献 · 郑谷","name":"从叔郎中諴辍自秋曹分符安陆属羣盗倡炽流毒江壖竟以援兵不来城池失守例削今任却叙省衔退居荆汉之间颇得琴尊之趣因有寄献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华省称前任，何慙削一麾。\n沧洲失孤垒，白发出重围。\n苦节翻多难，空山自喜归。\n悠悠清汉上，渔者日相依。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37533.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37533","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}